<title>HONG KONG: AsiaSat announces 1st interim results.</title>
<headline>AsiaSat announces 1st interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	HK$0.43</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    166.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		     357.7</p>
<p>    Company name		 Asia Satellite Telecommunications</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Satellite operator Asia Satellite is owned in equal parts by Hutchison Whampoa Ltd, Britain's Cable &amp; Wireless Plc and Beijing's state-owned flagship China International Trust and Investment Corp (CITIC). It was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on June 19, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
